[[0,1396663,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-08T01:23:35","pedestrian_x","",[],"","Pig God. Some shitlording I found in One Punch Man.","https://i.sli.mg/E6dsA3.jpg","fatpeoplehate"],[1,6755818,0,5,0,5,"2016-11-08T01:46:04","I_like_tacos","",[],"<p>Replace &quot;pig god&quot; to &quot;average American.&quot; </p>"],[2,6755834,6755818,3,0,3,"2016-11-08T01:48:47","pedestrian_x","",[],"<p>Good point, I guess it's only a pig god to the Japanese.</p>"],[1,6755995,0,10,0,10,"2016-11-08T02:16:19","Jimmy_Two_Fingers","",[],"<p>The Japanese love shitlording. Always great when I see it in anime.</p>"],[1,6757029,0,4,0,4,"2016-11-08T04:48:25","Carsandsarcasm","",[],"<p>Imagine if a fat had a god's immortality. How fat would they get if obesity related heath complications couldn't slow them down? Would there be a limit? Would they burst? I guess at some point, diminishing returns would catch up to them and they couldn't match their BMR anymore, but there are mortal fats putting away 30,000 calories every day. That's pretty huge. I guess they would be limited by when they got so fat they couldn't reach their hand to their mouth. </p>"],[2,6761383,6757029,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T19:35:18","New_Targaryen_Empire","",[],"<p>Yeah, but they have those disgusting excuses for human beings known as feeders to shove more food in their mouths so not enough that will stop them... scary to think about really.</p>"],[2,6765067,6757029,1,0,1,"2016-11-09T03:28:05","theepilepticferret","[e]",[],"<p>I always wonder if it's possible for an adipose monster to expand so rapidly that its skin bursts. I mean, I know that's sort of what stretch marks are, but I wonder if it's possible for the skin to just rip all the way through, past the dermis and exposing the fat layer beneath.</p>"],[3,6765298,6765067,1,0,1,"2016-11-09T03:51:34","Carsandsarcasm","",[],"<p>I can only imagine it runs out of elasticity and just sort of ... gives out? Like you get so fat that your insides burst through the tortured, weak skin. That would leave pig god immortal with his insides and adipose tissue strewn about. I bet he would keep eating. </p>"],[1,6757530,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-08T06:42:36","Bobsentme","",[],"<p>God I loved One Punch Man. Wish the anime was a lot longer.</p>"],[2,6757901,6757530,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T09:15:02","Artie","",[],"<p>Read the manga and the webcomic. Even then it isn't enough but still great on your phone if it's big enough.</p>"],[2,6772673,6757530,0,0,0,"2016-11-09T19:01:01","machiko","",[],"<p>Season 2 is happening so we will have more!</p>"],[1,6757908,0,2,0,2,"2016-11-08T09:17:04","Artie","",[],"<p>At least Pig God could eat monsters. Fat fucks in reality LOSE IN EATING COMPETITIONS. Not to mention Pig God is immensely strong and fast, the opposite of a real fatty.</p>"],[1,6759030,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T14:11:29","okporpoise","",[],"<p>I saw a horror anime before in which a fat fuck caused the death of one of her friends because she was too tired to run/move. Fucking fatties ruin everything.</p>"]]
